# Names only. Used later by Docker Compose. Do not put real keys in this file.
# Local `dotnet run` does not read .env. Use `dotnet user-secrets` (see the README).
# ASP.NET Core maps "__" to ":".
# A leaked key is rotated. Deleting the commit is not enough.
